t":"If you [have reason to] fear from a people betrayal, throw [their treaty] back to them, [putting you] on equal terms. Indeed, Allāh does not like traitors.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"8:59","t":"And let not those who disbelieve think they will escape. Indeed, they will not cause failure [to Allāh].","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"8:60","t":"And prepare against them whatever you are able of power and of steeds of war by which you may terrify the enemy of Allāh and your enemy and others besides them whom you do not know [but] whom Allāh knows. And whatever you spend in the cause of Allāh will be fully repaid to you, and you will not be wronged.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"8:61","t":"And if they incline to peace, then incline to it [also] and rely upon Allāh. Indeed, it is He who is the Hearing, the Knowing.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":61,"sd":null}],"juz":10,"hizb":19,"surahs":[8],"sajdah":false}